    "# 08 Microstructure Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook investigates microstructural evolution in spray-pyrolyzed apatite–wollastonite glass-ceramic systems using SEM observations.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Research Question\n",
    "\n",
    "How does thermal processing influence microstructure, degradation morphology, and mineral-layer formation?\n",
    "\n",
    "## Kinetic Blueprint Context\n",
    "\n",
    "Previous analyses established:\n",
    "\n",
    "Thermal Processing\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Crystallization\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Phase Architecture\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Transport Behavior\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Microenvironment Evolution\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Biological Response\n",
    "\n",
    "The SEM dataset adds the microstructural layer connecting phase architecture to transport behavior."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "ROOT_DIR = Path(\"..\")\n",
    "DATA_DIR = ROOT_DIR / \"data\"\n",
    "\n",
    "sem_df = pd.read_csv(DATA_DIR / \"sem_metadata.csv\")\n",
    "\n",
    "display(sem_df)\n",
    "sem_df[\n",
    "    [\n",
    "        \"Sintering_Temp_C\",\n",
    "        \"Condition\",\n",
    "        \"Observed_Surface_Morphology\"\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Initial Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "Distinct microstructural regimes emerge across the processing window.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 700 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "As-sintered:\n",
    "- Unconsolidated porous matrix\n",
    "- High residual amorphous content\n",
    "\n",
    "After SBF:\n",
    "- Severe micro-fissuring\n",
    "- Structural fragmentation\n",
    "- Disordered apatite formation\n",
    "\n",
    "### 800–900 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "As-sintered:\n",
    "- Progressive consolidation\n",
    "- Reduced porosity\n",
    "\n",
    "After SBF:\n",
    "- Increasingly uniform apatite precipitation\n",
    "- Reduced degradation severity\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1000 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "As-sintered:\n",
    "- Maximum bulk densification\n",
    "\n",
    "After SBF:\n",
    "- Dense interconnected fluorapatite layer\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1100 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "As-sintered:\n",
    "- Dense Wollastonite–Whitlockite framework\n",
    "\n",
    "After SBF:\n",
    "- Compact needle-like fluorapatite barrier\n",
    "\n",
    "These observations suggest that thermal processing governs degradation morphology through control of phase architecture and microstructural stability."
   ]
  }
 ],
