    "## Microstructure and Transport Mechanism\n",
    "\n",
    "### Scientific Motivation\n",
    "\n",
    "SEM observations reveal substantial differences in consolidation, porosity, mineral-layer formation, and degradation morphology across the processing window.\n",
    "\n",
    "These microstructural differences are expected to influence transport behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "The following analysis links observed surface morphology to the transport mechanisms identified in the Kinetic Blueprint framework."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "transport_df = kb_df[\n",
    "    [\"Temperature_C\", \"Transport_Mechanism\"]\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "transport_df"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Microstructure–Transport Relationship\n",
    "\n",
    "### 700 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "Observed Microstructure:\n",
    "- Porous unconsolidated matrix\n",
    "- Severe post-SBF fragmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "Transport Implication:\n",
    "- High accessibility to SBF\n",
    "- Dissolution-dominated transport\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 800–900 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "Observed Microstructure:\n",
    "- Progressive consolidation\n",
    "- Reduced porosity\n",
    "- More uniform apatite precipitation\n",
    "\n",
    "Transport Implication:\n",
    "- Mixed transport behavior\n",
    "- Balanced degradation and mineralization\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1000 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "Observed Microstructure:\n",
    "- Maximum densification\n",
    "- Continuous fluorapatite coverage\n",
    "\n",
    "Transport Implication:\n",
    "- Controlled transport\n",
    "- Stable interfacial evolution\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1100 °C\n",
    "\n",
    "Observed Microstructure:\n",
    "- Dense Wollastonite–Whitlockite framework\n",
    "- Compact needle-like fluorapatite barrier\n",
    "\n",
    "Transport Implication:\n",
    "- Diffusion-governed transport\n",
    "- Highest structural stability\n",
    "\n",
    "These observations indicate that thermal processing influences transport behavior through its effect on microstructure and phase architecture."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Microstructural Extension of the Kinetic Blueprint Framework\n",
    "\n",
    "### Scientific Synthesis\n",
    "\n",
    "The SEM dataset extends the Kinetic Blueprint framework by introducing microstructure as an intermediate layer between phase architecture and transport behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "The resulting hierarchy becomes:\n",
    "\n",
    "Thermal Processing\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Crystallization Pathways\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Phase Architecture\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Microstructure\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Transport Behavior\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Microenvironment Evolution\n",
    "↓\n",
    "Biological Response\n",
    "\n",
    "Key observations include:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Porous microstructures promote dissolution-dominated transport.\n",
    "- Dense consolidated microstructures suppress degradation.\n",
    "- Uniform mineral-layer formation stabilizes the interface.\n",
    "- Protective fluorapatite layers regulate transport and biological response.\n",
    "\n",
    "These findings suggest that microstructural engineering provides an additional pathway for deterministic control of materials performance."
   ]
  }
